{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"FINAL RECORD — stability investigation (2026-08-30 → 09-01), full results of research, discussion, findings and proposals. Corpus: .scratch/stability-analysis/ (50+ files; git-ignored — durable copies of anything needed long-term should be promoted to reports/ or docs/).\n\n=== ARC ===\nRound 1 (overnight 08-30/31): mined 3,139 tickets, 2,841 commits, 2,000+ Gerrit changes, 70 janitor files, 104 ADRs; 6 OSS-research packets; store prototype (E1), landing/gate-yield data (E2); diagnosis + 5-week plan; red-teamed by 2 max-effort critics + 3 cross-model reviews (GPT-5.6, gpt-oss-120b, DeepSeek). Operator review then exposed two systematic error patterns in round 1: metrics consumed without reading mechanisms (P6 misread — it is an advisory-by-design DET lint; \"zero reverts\"; an invalid completion-verifier FP proxy; formula-era pooling) and intentional tradeoffs labeled defects (RIN + scheduled-CI backstop; whole-HEAD attestation fallback with the no_file_impact escape; bug-tier plan review by design). Round 2 (operator-directed): re-derived everything mechanism-first — R2S1 120-bug mechanism-read sample (seed 20260831), R2S2 Jira-bridge deep-dive, R2S3 decision archaeology (21-row index; 11 settled decisions lack ADRs) + 60-session friction accounting, R2S4 era-aware gate forensics (4 formula eras), R2O1 Opus store-design validation. Synthesis 09-complete-picture.md. Plan run through a second cross-model adversarial pass on Bedrock (DeepSeek/gpt-oss/Mistral; 10-bedrock-adversarial-review.md) then grounded by three passes: 12a codebase truth, 12b 2026-published research, 12c OSS precedent. Final plan: 11-plan-v3.md (v3.1).\n\n=== SETTLED FINDINGS ===\n(1) The acute pain is a defect-rework loop on REAL, well-filed defects (79% executed repros; 82% regression tests; speculative only 3.3%). Three introduction engines ≈55% of the stream: gate-infrastructure RUNTIME defects 20.8% (ordinary code bugs — fail-open wiring, concurrency at ~90 worktrees, budget/timeout gaps; NOT formula churn, 0%); representation drift (schema vs hand-maintained mirror) dominant within product-logic 18.3%; test isolation under parallelism 15.8%. Co-engine: 56% of fixes ADD a mechanism (0 reverts/2,720 commits; defensive counts grew 2-12x code). (2) Friction (sessions' own words): review rework 44/60, real CI regressions at landing 25/60 (doubling), gate re-runs 14/60, environment 13/60 (doubling), store 3/60. (3) Store transport: 5% of defects (hot-path rearchitecture already landed) but CRITICAL-PATH — PASS-but-unsigned chain; live incidents during this very investigation (compact-sweep stale-holder wedge → P1 bug avoided-flannel-eeve, still open; a 181s lock-timeout while filing a ticket). (4) Gates: thresholds calibrated (ADR 0036 dry-runs) and frozen since 07-30; residual instability = 19.9% PASS<->BLOCK judge noise on identical material (2026 research: measured phenomenon at temp 0) + 60% of flips INDETERMINATE infra/budget churn treated as BLOCK. (5) Jira bridge: 86 real bugs (20% of counted titles were bot-alert dupes), share FALLING 13.6%→8.2%, classes being structurally retired; two open: mapping parity, idempotency/dedup. (6) M7 (operator hypothesis): speculative filing is a real but minor loop (3.3% read-confirmed; 17% was a language-marker overcount) → P11 norm: bugs need executed evidence; sweeps file one class ticket; guards ship with a failing test. (7) Decision discoverability is a live tax: this investigation re-proposed two already-settled designs; 11 settled-by-analysis decisions have no ADR (R2S3 index). (8) Store destination validated (R2O1): the reducer is already convergence-safe; the materializer pattern already ships in certified close; destination C = per-environment refs + materializer via flock+CAS substrate A (E1: 8-16 writers, 667 SIGKILLs, zero lock artifacts; pure CAS refuted — livelock); three hard blockers: freshness.py whole-branch predicate, receipts need merge-not-rebase, paths.py canonical-store invariant.\n\n=== PLAN v3.1 (11-plan-v3.md; grounded, 12a/12b/12c annexes) ===\nTRACK I — reduce introduction (epic wide-wimpy-insect, see below). TRACK II — loop integrity: II-1 gate-runtime hardening (taxonomy coverage verification — epic 3405 CLOSED; NEW pre-flight resource-budget guard w/ RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED status, exit ≤2% of runs 2 consecutive weeks; EXTEND existing plan_review/reuse.py cache with formula-CONTENT hashing per Bazel action-digest pattern; concurrency tests at real parallelism; flip-case mechanism read ≥30 cases via the ADR 0109 replay harness before any further judge work); II-2 store staged (stage 0 per-scope freshness predicate design = hard blocker; stage 1 flock+CAS for the 29 append_event call sites → ends PASS-but-unsigned; stage 2 reads-from-tree + single flusher; stage 3 per-environment refs + materializer; claim stays provisional T1). BACKGROUND: B-1 bridge idempotency seam (IETF Idempotency-Key semantics + reconciliation polling) + Cloud<->DC parity gate; B-2 janitor REPAIRED not deleted (span-level file:line citation checks that fail the run; incurred-cost-over-blast-radius prioritization — it currently recommends high-risk/high-effort changes; deterrent test D1-D3 for zero-yield mechanisms; Renovate-style rate limits; preserve its discovery/verification insights); B-3 decisions index (promote the 11; NB the calibration ADR is 0036 — 0108 is the severity retirement); B-4 doctor env checks on flutter-doctor's registration architecture (brew doctor = the accretion anti-pattern). NOT DOING: criteria posture changes, merge-queue/per-commit CI (accepted RIN tradeoff), suite-wide test reduction, history rewrite, prose enforcement, any new mechanism without named retirement.\n\n=== TRACK I EPIC (created this session) ===\nEpic wide-wimpy-insect (87cb-7121-a3b6-4606), decomposed per decomp-shape principles: six VERTICAL slices, no sibling produces an artifact another consumes → no ordering edges, fully parallel under next-batch; epic ACs each map to a child (G3 coverage) + a documentation AC. Children: cream-capitate-snake (8ce5: MCP-tool-surface vs library-facade parity gate — the one confirmed ungated mirror), yogic-soapstone-takin (f9b9: mirror inventory sweep, reports/stability/mirror-inventory.md), washedup-ropeable-hammerkop (15f2: collection-time enforcement — unit-tier subprocess tests take roots from the harness), silverish-parodic-quoll (b0ac: key process-local caches/temp artifacts by isolation root — retires the 89981d8e class), unblacked-loveless-toad (9ca8: check_mechanism_delta.py, per-(kind,name) shrink-only baseline, 7 kinds, make lint + Verified), floaty-imperfect-pomeranian (0880: upstream measurement — change-shape backtest extension + 20-case CI-at-landing read + environment read; enforcement decision recorded either way). All carry file_impact.\n\n=== SHIPPED DURING THE INVESTIGATION ===\nhorrendous-limpid-chamois: enrich producer gated on drain config + suggest_duplicate_tickets=false — MERGED (Gerrit 2464, 05be3a4d), closed with both attestations, no force. balding-facial-huemul: completion-sidecar material fingerprint — filed, independently CLOSED (versions now stamped both sides). avoided-flannel-eeve (P1, OPEN): MCP write path wedged by dead-pid holder stamp read as live; executed evidence in ticket; MCP writes recovered since but root cause unfixed.\n\n=== STANDING LESSONS (for any future investigating session) ===\n(1) Prove mechanisms by reading/executing them, never infer from counts — both rounds' error budgets came from violating this. (2) Check design intent (ADRs, session logs, code comments) before calling behavior a defect. (3) Re-verify premises at claim time: FIVE plan claims went stale within 48h of drafting (epic 3405 closed; balding closed; e63c mirror already unified; reuse.py cache already existing; append_event 29 not 72 sites). (4) Cross-model review earns its cost (found the two weakest joints Claude-family drafting smoothed over) but alternative models also fabricate — convergence-then-verify. (5) Enforcement belongs at the three gates and the deterministic substrate; prose is not load-bearing; no calendar exits; polyglot seams."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788311698307427838,"uuid":"30e723d7-8657-4876-b483-b1a4a5a402c1"}